pan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为分配给人和机器人的子任务集合。</p>\n<p><strong>时序协调</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协调模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顺序式</td>\n<td>一方完成后另一方接续</td>\n<td>人放零件→机器人焊接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行式</td>\n<td>双方同时工作于不同部分</td>\n<td>双方各装配一侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交织式</td>\n<td>动态交替操作</td>\n<td>人扶住工件→机器人拧螺丝→人调整位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"情感计算与社交信号\">情感计算与社交信号</h3><p>社会机器人需要理解和适当回应人类的情感状态：</p>\n<p><strong>多模态情感识别</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>emotion</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{emotion} = f(v_{face}, a_{voice}, t_{text}, p_{posture})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">emotion</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>融合面部表情（AU 单元）、语音韵律、语言内容和身体姿态。</p>\n<p><strong>社交距离（Proxemics）</strong>：Edward Hall 的空间距离理论应用于机器人行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>亲密距离：&lt; 0.45m（仅限护理/辅助场景）</li>\n<li>个人距离：0.45-1.2m（对话交互）</li>\n<li>社交距离：1.2-3.6m（服务递送）</li>\n<li>公共距离：&gt; 3.6m（导引）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>机器人应根据社交情境动态调整与人的距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>relationship</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>context</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>culture</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>task</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{desired} = f(\\text{relationship}, \\text{context}, \\text{culture}, \\text{task})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">relationship</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">context</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">culture</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">task</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"自然语言交互\">自然语言交互</h3><p>服务机器人需要流畅的语音/文字对话能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多轮对话管理</strong>：维护对话状态、处理上下文引用</li>\n<li><strong>澄清与确认</strong>：面对模糊指令主动提问（&quot;你说的杯子是红色那个还是蓝色那个？&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>非言语沟通</strong>：通过注视方向、手势、LED 灯效传达意图</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>具身对话</strong>的特殊挑战：对话内容与物理环境紧密耦合，机器人需要边说边做、边做边观察反馈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"应用场景\">应用场景</h3><h4 id=\"工业协作装配\">工业协作装配</h4><ul>\n<li>人负责精密操作和质量判断</li>\n<li>机器人负责重复搬运、力控拧紧和位姿保持</li>\n<li>关键：节拍同步、防碰撞预判</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"医疗与康复辅助\">医疗与康复辅助</h4><ul>\n<li>辅助行走（外骨骼）、进食辅助、康复训练</li>\n<li>关键：极高安全等级、个性化适应、舒适性</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"家庭服务\">家庭服务</h4><ul>\n<li>整理物品、端茶送水、陪伴对话</li>\n<li>关键：多样化环境适应、长期自主运行、用户偏好学习</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"教育与陪伴\">教育与陪伴</h4><ul>\n<li>面向儿童或老人的互动式教学与陪伴</li>\n<li>关键：情感响应、长期关系维持、内容生成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Figure 02 + ChatGPT (2025)</strong>：人形机器人通过自然对话理解复杂指令并协作完成厨房任务</li>\n<li><strong>Social Navigation Benchmark</strong>：在有行人的真实购物中心中评估机器人的社交导航能力</li>\n<li><strong>可解释协作</strong>：机器人通过语言或手势解释自己的行为意图（&quot;我要从你左边经过&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>多人协作</strong>：一个机器人同时与多个人类协作者互动，处理优先级冲突</li>\n<li><strong>文化适应性</strong>：同一机器人在不同文化背景下展现不同的社交距离和交互风格</li>\n<li><strong>RLHF for Robots</strong>：通过人类偏好反馈优化机器人的社交行为质量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个人机协作桌面整理场景的安全控制方案：机器人（7-DOF 机械臂）和人类共享一张桌面。实现基于距离的速度限制——当人手距机械臂 &lt; 0.3m 时速度降至 10%，&lt; 0.1m 时立即停止。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>实现一个简单的人体意图预测器：输入过去 1 秒的手部轨迹（30 帧 3D 坐标），预测未来 0.5 秒的手部位置。使用 LSTM 或 Transformer 架构，在 H3.6M 数据集上训练和评估。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：一个配送机器人在走廊中遇到迎面走来的行人。讨论以下三种策略的优劣：（a）停下等待行人通过；（b）主动让到一侧继续前进；（c）减速并根据行人动态调整路径。哪种策略最&quot;社交&quot;？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个协作装配任务的 FSM（有限状态机）：人和机器人共同组装一个由 3 个零件组成的产品。定义状态（等待、递件、装配、检验等）、转换条件和安全规则。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>人机协作与社会机器人代表了具身智能走向真实应用的&quot;最后一公里&quot;——不仅要求机器人具备感知、规划和操作能力，还要求它理解人类意图、遵守社会规范、保障物理安全并建立信任关系。从工业协作到家庭服务，每个场景都对安全性、自然性和适应性提出了独特需求。随着基础模型赋予机器人语言理解和常识推理能力，真正的&quot;与人共处&quot;的机器人正从实验走向日常。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人机协作与社会机器人","id":"人机协作与社会机器人"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"安全交互原则","id":"安全交互原则"},{"level":3,"text":"意图预测与人体运动预估","id":"意图预测与人体运动预估"},{"level":3,"text":"协作任务规划","id":"协作任务规划"},{"level":3,"text":"情感计算与社交信号","id":"情感计算与社交信号"},{"level":3,"text":"自然语言交互","id":"自然语言交互"},{"level":3,"text":"应用场景","id":"应用场景"},{"level":4,"text":"工业协作装配","id":"工业协作装配"},{"level":4,"text":"医疗与康复辅助","id":"医疗与康复辅助"},{"level":4,"text":"家庭服务","id":"家庭服务"},{"level":4,"text":"教育与陪伴","id":"教育与陪伴"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"具身导航与探索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/frontiers-and-applications/embodied-navigation"},"next":null}